  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tendely Cereal Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to strengthen the Union s production and marketing capacity and that of its members for cereals; mainly cowpeas and millet. Project funds will help the Union develop its financial and management capacity to better plan members production and to negotiate better prices and marketing contracts with its buyers.</narrative>
  </description>
